{#- templates/_theme_research_mounts.html.j2 — Theme Tracker theme-research aggregator.

  ONE place that owns the per-vertical loop for theme-research mounts on the
  Theme Tracker, mirroring _basket_intelligence_mounts.html.j2 on the basket
  page. Each registered vertical whose anchor is a theme row on the page gets
  one section, rendered by _theme_research_section.html.j2 from the
  registration; `ignore missing` so an absent partial never breaks the
  incumbent page. Empty list -> nothing renders. Emits no bytes of its own.

  The loop lives HERE rather than inline in state_of_themes.html.j2 because
  that page's last `endfor` is a load-bearing anchor: tests/
  test_finance_entry_points.py locates the lanes loop with rfind on it. An
  inline loop on the tracker moved that anchor past the finance include and
  failed their ordering guard even though the invariant it protects still
  held. Keeping the loop behind an include leaves the tracker's last `endfor`
  the lanes loop, and the rendered bytes identical.
-#}
{% for tr_mount in theme_research_mounts or [] %}{% include "_theme_research_section.html.j2" ignore missing %}{% endfor %}
